 *
 * Two consequences worth knowing while it lives here: it is re-sent with
 * every Mageplaza AJAX filter/sort response (it replaces the previous copy
 * rather than stacking), and it cannot be cached separately from the HTML.
 * Both disappear when it moves into the LESS file, which is a copy-paste —
 * every rule below already uses the theme's semantic tokens and logical
 * properties, so nothing needs rewriting.
 *
 * Filter-sidebar rules are keyed off #layered-filter-block because that is
 * the real ID Mageplaza's own layer/view.phtml emits; matching the existing
 * _plp.less selector shape means this block WINS on source order instead of
 * escalating specificity. There is not one !important below.
 */
